   "value": "<p><em>Projection Sorcery — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, due to your advanced studies, you can now reach a higher speed level than any sorcerer ever could. While your cursed technique is active, you will gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You gain +30 feet to your walking speed.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You gain +20 feet to your walking speed at the beginning of your turns.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You have advantage on Dexterity saving throws.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your Dexterity score increases by +2 ignoring your maximum.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
